Z||000000||Turbo1dr||03-19-2001||01:27 AM||||It's an 86 SE automatic converted to a GT.  I already have a rear wing coming in the mail.  The paint is really faded so just to make the car look better I wet it with water then took the pictures. I can't complain since I bought both Fiero's from salvage yards!  I've been driving the car around with no inspection or tags. I live in a small town with only one way in and one way out. Hardly any cops around to patrol the area! I am getting tags and insurance this week though. <P>If the picture don't show below just click here if you want to see more:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/fiero</A> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/fiero/Rh.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>86 SE Fiero converted to GT (Buick Turbo V6 transplant in progress)<P><B>78 Malibu</B> 3.8L Turbo Buick<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/Malibu/Homex.html" TARGET=_blank>TURBO WONDER</A><BR>Best 8th: 1.548, 6.62@106.32  3450lb<BR>TE-70 3 bolt, Ported Stock Iron Heads and Intake<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/Malibu/Modifications_files/Intercooler.jpg" TARGET=_blank>2.5 stock intercoolers</A><BR>Vernon Swindell, Jr.||||reg||1
